5 Sec. 12. CESA TRANSITION
6 (a) Within 30 days following the passage of this act, each member
7 supervisory union board of each CESA created under 16 V.S.A. § 603(a) shall
8 appoint a person to serve on the board of directors of the applicable CESA
9 pursuant to 16 V.S.A. § 603(c).
10 (b) Within 45 days following the passage of this act, the superintendent of
11 the supervisory union with the highest aggregate average daily membership of
12 each CESA created under 16 V.S.A. § 603(a) shall call a meeting of the
13 directors of the CESA at which each CESA board shall elect a chair and other
14 necessary officers.
15 (c) The articles of agreement of the Vermont Learning Collaborative
16 (VTLC) in effect on June 30, 2026, shall serve as the operating agreement of
17 the VTLC unless and until amended.

BILLAS PASSED BY THE HOUSE AND SENATE H.955
