(ii) initial or updated data findings including prekindergarten
student demographics and number of hours by prekindergarten program by
district;
(iii) outstanding questions or gaps in data; and
(iv) recommendations for legislative action and other
considerations.
(B) BBF shall also provide an update on progress of its work under
the federal Preschool Development Grant to the Joint Fiscal Committee on or
before October 1, 2026.
(3)(A) The Joint Fiscal Office shall contract with a contractor with
