(e) When an appeal to the Commissioner is not withdrawn or forwarded by
the Commissioner to the Superior Court pursuant to subsection (a) of this
section, the Commissioner shall conduct a hearing in accordance with 3 V.S.A.
chapter 25.
(f) The Commissioner or court shall proceed de novo on all appeals and
determine the correct valuation of the property as promptly as practicable and

