VALLEY TECHNICAL CENTER MEMBERSHIP
On or before December 15, 2027, the River Valley Technical Center School
District and Vermont Learning Collaborative shall propose a membership
adjustment pursuant to 16 V.S.A. § 608 to the General Assembly to formally
