(42) “Student” means a pupil enrolled in and assigned to a school as of
October 1.
(43) “Teacher of record” means the educator primarily responsible for
delivering instruction, assessing student learning, and assigning grades for a
class, as designated in a school district’s student information system.
* * *
Sec. 29d. DEFINITION RULEMAKING; STATE BOARD OF
EDUCATION
The State Board of Education shall adopt rules pursuant to 3 V.S.A. chapter
25 that establish definitions for the terms contained in 16 V.S.A. § 11(a)(36)–
(43). The Board may adopt rules pursuant to this section with definitions for
the terms that differ from the definitions contained in statute.

