each school board to participate on a merger committee to study the
advisability of forming a unified union school district; or
(ii) a school district with an average daily membership of at least
2,000 students.
(b) Emergency aid. Notwithstanding any other provision of this section,
the Secretary may grant aid for a project the Secretary deems to be an
emergency in the amount of 30 percent of eligible project costs, up to a
maximum eligible total project cost of $300,000.00.
(c) Wage requirements. Any contract awarded for school construction that
